WEBVTT

00:00:09.541 --> 00:00:10.916
[♪ triumphant music playing]

00:00:14.708 --> 00:00:15.541
-[grunts]
-[gasps]

00:00:15.625 --> 00:00:16.625
Judy!

00:00:16.708 --> 00:00:17.750
[panting]

00:00:21.375 --> 00:00:23.833
-[worker] Snake!
-[Pawbert] Power control room?

00:00:23.916 --> 00:00:25.916
Uh, five flights up.
Come on, hurry!

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.375
[Gary pants]
That is a lot of stairs.

00:00:29.458 --> 00:00:32.708
Way to hustle, bud, I love ya!
I owe ya!

00:00:34.125 --> 00:00:37.208
Whoa, whoa, whoa. It's
turning on. It's turning on!

00:00:37.291 --> 00:00:38.291
[Nibbles grunts]

00:00:39.583 --> 00:00:41.458
No. Nibbles?

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:43.208
[alarm blaring]

00:00:45.291 --> 00:00:46.666
Nibbles!

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:47.750
[Judy grunts]

00:00:47.833 --> 00:00:50.500
[gasps] Snake! [grunts]

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:52.041
Cold!

00:00:52.125 --> 00:00:54.666
[grunting, panting]
It's jammed.

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:57.458
Don't worry about me.
Find the switch.

00:00:58.125 --> 00:00:59.625
[Judy]
No, no, no, no. Not these.

00:00:59.708 --> 00:01:02.291
It would be, uh... older.

00:01:02.375 --> 00:01:03.541
[♪ tense music playing]

00:01:09.583 --> 00:01:10.916
[Judy straining]

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:11.958
[all straining]

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:19.791
Can you see it?

00:01:20.541 --> 00:01:22.916
Did we turn on the clock
tower? [breathes heavily]

00:01:23.666 --> 00:01:24.500
[gasps]

00:01:25.666 --> 00:01:27.791
There! [breathes deeply]

00:01:28.416 --> 00:01:29.791
It's there!

00:01:32.291 --> 00:01:33.333
[Pawbert stammers]

00:01:33.416 --> 00:01:36.958
We did it? We can find
the original patent?

00:01:38.958 --> 00:01:40.041
[Judy] Nick?

00:01:40.583 --> 00:01:42.708
The door... It's locked...
We have to...

00:01:42.791 --> 00:01:44.000
How did it lock?

00:01:44.083 --> 00:01:46.291
Nibbles? [straining] Open it.

00:01:47.083 --> 00:01:49.125
[grunts, yells] Nibbles!

00:01:49.208 --> 00:01:50.833
[grunting]

00:01:50.916 --> 00:01:52.666
Dang door stuck on me.

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:53.750
[Judy sighs]

00:01:53.833 --> 00:01:55.041
Sorry.

00:01:55.125 --> 00:01:57.708
Last case
there was kind of a twist.

00:01:58.291 --> 00:01:59.291
I know.

00:01:59.375 --> 00:02:00.375
[yelps]

00:02:00.458 --> 00:02:01.291
[♪ dramatic music playing]

00:02:01.375 --> 00:02:03.125
-[Pawbert gasping]
-[Judy grunts]

00:02:03.208 --> 00:02:04.875
Oh, my gosh. [chuckles]
I really...

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:07.208
Oh, my heart is pounding.
[chuckles]

00:02:07.291 --> 00:02:09.083
I thought you knew.
I thought you knew.

00:02:09.166 --> 00:02:10.083
-No. [hisses]
-Whoa.

00:02:10.166 --> 00:02:12.875
-[straining]
-Sorry, partner. [grunts]

00:02:14.083 --> 00:02:16.458
Hate to leave you
out in the cold... [chuckles]

00:02:16.541 --> 00:02:18.708
...but I'm gonna.

00:02:18.791 --> 00:02:21.708
[groans]
Please don't be mad at me.

00:02:22.250 --> 00:02:25.166
But, I mean, you get it.
[chuckles]

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:28.625
We've always been
on the same page. Me and you!

00:02:28.708 --> 00:02:30.750
Underdogs, right?

00:02:30.833 --> 00:02:34.000
You gotta prove you're as good
as everyone else.

00:02:34.083 --> 00:02:36.166
That you belong.

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:39.083
[inhales] I know,
it's messed up... [sighs]

00:02:39.166 --> 00:02:41.750
...but this is my chance.

00:02:41.833 --> 00:02:43.291
I have to take it.

00:02:43.958 --> 00:02:46.708
'Cause when I get
to his great-grandma's home,

00:02:46.791 --> 00:02:49.000
and I burn
the original patent,

00:02:49.541 --> 00:02:52.125
I'll finally be something
in my family.

00:02:53.166 --> 00:02:55.541
And I'll finally belong too.

00:02:55.625 --> 00:02:56.916
[Nick, through TV]
Judy?

00:02:57.916 --> 00:02:59.875
[Pawbert] Ruh-roh.

00:02:59.958 --> 00:03:01.208
Carrots?

00:03:03.958 --> 00:03:07.208
[clicks tongue, sighs]
No loose ends.

00:03:09.458 --> 00:03:10.875
Bye, partner.

00:03:14.208 --> 00:03:15.625
Bye, Judy Hopps.

00:03:19.208 --> 00:03:21.416
Pawbert. Please.

00:03:22.208 --> 00:03:25.291
You can be different
than your family.

00:03:27.291 --> 00:03:29.000
I don't want to be different.

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:34.125
[groans] Nick...

00:03:36.541 --> 00:03:38.125
[Nick] Judy?

00:03:42.208 --> 00:03:44.250
[machinery whirring]

00:03:45.666 --> 00:03:46.833
Judy?

00:03:47.541 --> 00:03:48.958
Nibbles, do you see her?

00:03:49.041 --> 00:03:50.791
No, nothing yet.

00:03:52.125 --> 00:03:53.291
[Nick] Judy.

00:03:53.375 --> 00:03:55.666
Nick. [breathes shakily]

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:57.291
Ni... [breathes heavily]

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:02.750
[Gary] We shall succeed,

00:04:03.416 --> 00:04:04.625
Judy Hopps.

00:04:04.708 --> 00:04:08.375
[grunts, stammering]

00:04:10.416 --> 00:04:12.708
It's okay. Judy sent me.

00:04:12.791 --> 00:04:14.875
She needs to find Nick.

00:04:14.958 --> 00:04:15.958
[groans]

00:04:16.916 --> 00:04:19.708
Yep.
Should've seen that coming.

00:04:19.791 --> 00:04:20.791
[groans]

00:04:20.875 --> 00:04:22.416
[♪ ominous music playing]

00:04:23.458 --> 00:04:25.000
[Nick] Judy!

00:04:27.541 --> 00:04:29.375
Nick. [breathes shakily]

00:04:29.458 --> 00:04:35.291
We... shall... succeed.

00:04:35.875 --> 00:04:37.791
[straining]

00:04:38.333 --> 00:04:39.541
[Gary] Judy...

00:04:39.625 --> 00:04:44.166
[breathes shakily]
I can't move.

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:45.541
[♪ somber music playing]

00:04:45.625 --> 00:04:50.250
And you're too cold to help.

00:04:51.625 --> 00:04:52.916
[Judy]
And he's gonna...

00:04:54.208 --> 00:04:55.958
Nick's gonna...

00:04:56.041 --> 00:04:57.583
[Gary straining]
Judy...

00:04:58.125 --> 00:05:02.250
The world was
never meant to be

00:05:02.333 --> 00:05:05.625
on one animal's shoulders.

00:05:09.125 --> 00:05:13.666
That's why
my great-grandma wanted

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:18.458
Zootropolis to be for everyone.

00:05:18.958 --> 00:05:24.500
So, we could all help each
other. [breathes shakily]

00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:28.666
I didn't help.

00:05:30.625 --> 00:05:32.166
[Gary straining]
You did.

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:37.041
You chose to help me

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:45.166
and became
my best warm-blooded friend.

